DESCRIPTION:Carriers: UPS\nTakes effect Nov 16\, 2026.\nUPS · Domestic Air
  fuel surcharge table: same jet fuel price band now carries a higher perce
 ntage: +0.50 percentage points at the same fuel price\; other bands shown 
