 ble now starts at a lower fuel price\, with 28.50% beginning at $4.99 dies
 el: The published range now covers diesel prices from $4.99\; the 28.50% r
 ate that applied from $5.53 now applies from $4.99\nUPS · International G
 round Export/Import fuel surcharge table listed: $5.30 to under $5.42 dies
 el: 28.75%\; bands are $0.12 wide\, rising 0.25% per band\nStory: UPS rais
 es fuel surcharge percentages for each price band\, effective Nov 16\, 202
